{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2022-02-11 12:00:00', 'title': 'AMEREN CORPORATION INCREASES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND BY 7.3 PERCENT, MARKING NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF GROWTH', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, FEB. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF 59 CENTS PER SHARE, A 7.3% INCREASE FROM THE PRIOR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 55 CENTS PER SHARE, RESULTING IN AN ANNUALIZED EQUIVALENT DIVIDEND RATE OF $2.36 PER SHARE. THE PREVIOUS ANNUALIZED EQUIVALENT DIVIDEND RATE WAS $2.20 PER SHARE.'}